 =?UTF-8?q?e=20=E2=80=94=20Space=20Grotesk=20names,=20Space=20Mono=20caps?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20labels,=20white=20pills=20for=20selection=20(icons=20inverte?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20on=20them),=20grey=20pills=20on=20the=20open=20path?=
